(intercept-pair-trace)
*title Named two-vehicle intercept trace
*sixdof
*method rk45-var variable-mass
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84
*file intercept_pair_trace.dat time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt

*trajectory 1 interceptor start on 1
  *initial ecic x=20925646 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=300 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1965
  *print time alt vel range gamgd psigd p q r relrng[2]
  *segment 1 powered-interceptor
    *mass xcg=0 ixx=10 iyy=11 izz=12
    *aero caxial=0.5 cnormal=0.2
    *prop thrust=25000 mdot=3
    *when time>5 goto 2
  *segment 2 intercept-coast
    *aero constant_beta=200
    *when relvel[2]>0 stop

*trajectory 2 target start on 10
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=13000 alt=0 lat=0 long=0 vel=0 gama=79 psi=90
  *print time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt
  *segment 10 target-ascent
    *aero caxial=0.6 cnormal=0.15
    *prop thrust=30000 mdot=4
    *when tseg>8 goto 11
  *segment 11 target-coast
    *aero constant_beta=200
    *when alt<0 stop
*end
